    intro:
      "Teachers pay between 7.4% and 12.7% of salary into the Teachers' Pension Scheme, set by a tiered scale. Employers add 28.8% on top. This page gives the full 2026/27 tier table, worked examples for every pay point, and the rules that catch people out.",
