        "**Only nominating beneficiaries on the main scheme.** The AVC needs its own nomination.",
        "**Starting an AVC while opted out of the main scheme.** Always fix that first — the 28.8% employer contribution dwarfs any AVC benefit.",
        "**Forgetting the annual allowance.** All pension saving counts, including the deemed value of your TPS accrual.",
